      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Secretary General to the Treasury or a State financial authority, as the case may be, may, in writing, authorize any public officer under its purview to exercise the powers of investigation and enforcement under this Act in respect of Government procurement."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_45__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_45",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "There shall be issued to each authorized officer an authority card which shall be signed by the Secretary General to the Treasury or State financial authority, as the case may be."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_45__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_45",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Whenever such authorized officer exercises any of the powers under this Act, he shall on demand produce to the person against whom the power is being exercised the authority card issued to him under subsection (2). Power of investigation"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_46",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "46",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An authorized officer shall have all the powers necessary to carry out an investigation upon receiving any complaint or report, or upon any non-compliance under this Act or suspicion that any offence has been committed in relation to any Government procurement under this Act. Search and seizure with warrant"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "47",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_6",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_7"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If it appears to a Magistrate, upon written information on oath from an authorized officer and after such inquiry as the Magistrate considers necessary, that there is reasonable cause to believe that—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any premises has been used or is about to be used for; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "there is in any premises evidence necessary to the conduct of an investigation into, the commission of an offence in relation to any Government procurement under this Act, the Magistrate may issue a warrant authorizing any authorized officer named in the warrant, to enter the premises at any reasonable time by day or night, and with or without assistance, and if need be by force."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_2__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Without affecting the generality of subsection (1), the warrant issued by the Magistrate may authorize the authorized officer to—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "search and seize any record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated, which contain or are reasonably believed to contain information or furnish evidence of the commission of the offence;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "make copies of or take extracts from any record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "take samples of any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An authorized officer conducting a search under subsection (1) may, for the purpose of investigating into the offence, search any person who is in or on the premises."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An authorized officer making a search of a person under subsection (3) may seize, or take possession of, and place in safe custody all things, other than the necessary clothing, found upon the person, and any other thing, for which there is reason to believe that they are the instruments or other evidence of the offence, and they may be detained until the discharge or acquittal of the person."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No person shall be searched except by another person of the same gender, and such search shall be conducted with strict regard to decency."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If, by reason of its nature, size or amount, it is not practicable to remove any record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated seized under this section, the authorized officer who effected the seizure shall, by any means, seal such record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated in the premises or container in which it is found."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47__subsec_7",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person who, without lawful authority, breaks, tampers with or damages the seal referred to in subsection (6) or removes any record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated under seal or attempts to do so commits an offence. Search and seizure without warrant"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_48",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "48",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If an authorized officer is satisfied upon information received that he has reasonable cause to believe that by reason of delay in obtaining a search warrant under section 47, the investigation would be adversely affected or evidence of the commission of an offence is likely to be tampered with, removed, damaged or destroyed, the authorized officer may enter the premises and exercise in, upon and in respect of the premises all the powers referred to in section 47 in as full and ample a manner as if he were authorized to do so by a warrant issued under that section. Warrant admissible notwithstanding defect"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_49",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "49",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A search warrant issued under this Act shall be valid and enforceable notwithstanding any defect, mistake or omission in the search warrant or in the application for such warrant and any record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated seized under such warrant shall be admissible in evidence in any proceedings under this Act. Access to computerized data"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_50",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "50",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_50__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_50__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_50__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_50",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any authorized officer conducting a search under this Act shall be given access to computerized data whether stored in computer or otherwise."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_50__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_50",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this section, an authorized officer shall be provided with the necessary password, encryption code, decryption code, software or hardware and any other means required to enable the comprehension of the computerized data. List of things seized"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_51",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "51",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_51__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_51__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_51__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_51",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Except as provided in subsection (2), where any record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated is seized under this Part, the authorized officer who effected the seizure shall as soon as practicable prepare a list of the record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated seized and immediately deliver a copy of the list signed by him to the occupier of the premises which has been searched, or to his agent or servant, at the premises."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_51__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_51",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the premises is unoccupied, the authorized officer who effected the seizure shall wherever possible post the list of the things seized conspicuously on the premises. Release of things seized"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_52",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "52",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_52__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_52__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_52__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_52",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where any record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated has been seized under this Act, the authorized officer who effected the seizure, may at any time after that release the record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated seized to the person as he determines to be lawfully entitled to the record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated seized if he is satisfied that the record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated seized is not liable to forfeiture under this Act and is not otherwise required for the purpose of any proceedings under this Act, or for the purpose of any prosecution under any other written law, and in such event neither the officer effecting the seizure, nor the Government or any person acting on behalf of the Government shall be liable to any proceedings by any person if the seizure and the release of the record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated seized had been effected in good faith."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_52__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_52",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A record in writing shall be made by the authorized officer effecting the release of any record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated under subsection (1) specifying in detail the circumstances of, and the reason for, the release, and he shall send a copy of the record to the Public Prosecutor within seven days of the release. Forfeiture of things seized"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "53",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53__subsec_6",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53__subsec_7",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53__subsec_8"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated seized in the exercise of any power conferred under this Act shall be liable to forfeiture."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An order for the forfeiture of any record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated seized shall be made if it is proved to the satisfaction of the court that an offence under this Act has been committed and that the record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated seized was the subject matter of or was used in the commission of the offence, even though no person has been convicted of such offence."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where there is no prosecution with regard to any record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated seized under this Act, such record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated shall be taken as and deemed to be forfeited at the expiration of a period of one calendar month from the date of service of a notice to the last known address of the person from whom the record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated was seized indicating that there is no prosecution in respect of such record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated unless before the expiration of that period a claim thereto is made in the manner set out in subsections (4), (5), (6) and (7)."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person asserting that he is the owner of the record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated referred to in subsection (3) and that it is not liable to forfeiture, may, personally or by his agent authorized in writing, give a written notice to the authorized officer in whose possession such record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated is held that he is claiming the record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated that is to be forfeited."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Upon receipt of the notice referred to in subsection (4), the authorized officer shall refer the claim to a Magistrate for his decision."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Magistrate to whom a matter is referred under subsection (5) shall issue a summons requiring the person asserting that he is the owner of the record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated that is to be forfeited and the person from whom it was seized to appear before him, and when they appear or they fail to appear, due service of the summons having been proved, the Magistrate shall proceed to the examination of the matter."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53__subsec_7",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If it is proved that an offence under this Act has been committed and that the record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated referred to in subsection (6) was the subject matter of or was used in the commission of such offence, the Magistrate shall order the record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated to be forfeited, and shall, in the absence of such proof, order its release."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53__subsec_8",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated forfeited or deemed to be forfeited shall be delivered to the authorized officer and shall be disposed of in such manner as the authorized officer thinks fit. Property in forfeited things"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_54",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "54",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated, forfeited or deemed to be forfeited under this Act shall be the property of the Federal Government. No cost or damages arising from seizure to be recoverable"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_55",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "55",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No person shall, in any proceedings before any Court in respect of any record, books, account, documents, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated seized in the exercise or the purported exercise of any power conferred under this Act, be entitled to the costs of such proceedings or to any damages or other relief unless such seizure was made without reasonable cause. Power to require attendance of person acquainted with case"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "56",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An authorized officer making an investigation under this Act may, by order in writing, require the attendance before himself of any person who appears to the authorized officer to be acquainted with the facts and circumstances of the case, and such person shall attend as required."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If any such person refuses or fails to attend as required by an order made under subsection (1), the authorized officer may report his refusal or failure to a Magistrate who shall issue a warrant to secure the attendance of such person as may be required by the order. Examination of person acquainted with case"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "57",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_5"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An authorized officer making an investigation under this Act may examine orally any person supposed to be acquainted with the facts and circumstances of the case."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The person examined under subsection (1) shall be legally bound to answer all questions relating to such case put to him by the authorized officer, but such person may refuse to answer any question the answer to which would have a tendency to expose him to a criminal charge or penalty or forfeiture."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A person making a statement under this section shall be legally bound to state the truth, whether or not such statement is made wholly or partly in answer to the questions."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The authorized officer examining a person under subsection (1) shall first inform the person of the provisions of subsections (2) and (3)."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_5__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A statement made by any person under this section shall, wherever possible, be reduced into writing and signed by the person making it or affixed with his thumbprint, as the case may be—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "after it has been read to him in the language in which he made it; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57__subsec_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "after he has been given an opportunity to make any correction he may wish. Admissibility of statement in evidence"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "58",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_4"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If any person is charged with an offence under this Act, any statement, whether the statement amounts to a confession or not or whether it is oral or in writing, made at any time, whether before or after the person is charged and whether in the course of an investigation under this Act or not and whether or not wholly or partly in answer to questions, by that person to or in the hearing of an authorized officer and whether or not interpreted to him by another officer or other person, shall be admissible in evidence at his trial and, if the person charged tenders himself as witness, any such statement may be used in cross-examination and for the purpose of impeaching his credit."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A statement made under subsection (1) shall not be admissible or used—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "if the making of the statement appears to the court to have been caused by an inducement, threat or promise having reference to the charge against such person proceeding from a person in authority and sufficient, in the opinion of the court, to give that person grounds which would appear to him reasonable for supposing that by making it he would gain any advantage or avoid any evil of a temporal nature in reference to the proceedings against him; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the case of a statement made by the person after his arrest, unless the court is satisfied that he was cautioned in the following words or words to the like effect: “It is my duty to warn you that you are not obliged to say anything or to answer any question, but anything you say, whether in answer to a question or not, may be given in evidence.”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A statement made by a person before there is time to caution him shall not be rendered inadmissible in evidence merely by reason of his not having been cautioned if he had been cautioned as soon as possible after that."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in any written law, a person accused of an offence to which subsection (1) applies shall not be bound to answer any question relating to the case after any caution as referred to in paragraph (2)(b) had been administered to him. Obstruction"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "59",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_f"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person who—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "assaults, delays, impedes, hinders or obstructs an authorized officer in effecting any entrance which he is entitled to effect under this Act in the execution of any duty imposed or power conferred by this Act;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "breaks any seal that has been affixed by an authorized officer on any premises or place;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "fails to comply with any lawful demand of an authorized officer in the execution of his powers and duties under this Act;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "fails, refuses or omits to give any information, evidence or document which may be reasonably required by an authorized officer;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "without reasonable excuse fails to produce any record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated required by an authorized officer; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_f",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "f",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "provides any information, evidence or document that he knows or has reason to believe is false or misleading, in response to a direction issued by the authorized officer, commits an offence. Destruction, concealment, mutilation and alteration of records"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_60",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "60",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_60__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_60__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A person who—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_60__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_60",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "destroys, conceals, mutilates or alters; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_60__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_60",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "sends or attempts to send or conspires with any other person to remove from its premises or send out of Malaysia, any record, book, account, document, computerized data or other thing or any matter or thing that is the subject matter of Government procurement being investigated kept or maintained with intent to defraud the Treasury or State financial authority, as the case may be, the Registrar or any procuring entity, or to prevent, delay or obstruct the carrying out of an investigation or the exercise of any power by the Treasury or State financial authority, as the case may be, or the Registrar under this Act commits an offence."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "39",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_4"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Secretary General to the Treasury or State financial authority, as the case may be, shall have the general authority for monitoring compliance with this Act and any instructions, circulars or guidelines issued under this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2__para_e"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purpose of subsection (1), the Secretary General to the Treasury shall have the following powers:"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to conduct review and inspection on any Government procurement process by any procuring entity under its purview;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to conduct inspection on any registered person in relation to any Government procurement;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to conduct inquiry into any complaint or objection against any procuring entity;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to review the administration of complaints and objections by any procuring entity; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to do such things as may be necessary or expedient to give full effect to the provisions of this Act and any instructions, circulars or guidelines issued under this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purpose of subsection (1), the State financial authority shall have the powers under paragraphs (2)(a), (c), (d) and (e)."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Secretary General to the Treasury or State financial authority, as the case may be, shall appoint such number of public officers of the Treasury or ministry or department of a State charged with the responsibility for finance, as the case may be, as monitoring officers with powers to monitor compliance under this Part. Compliance monitoring by controlling officer"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "40",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40__subsec_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40__subsec_1__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A controlling officer shall be responsible—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to supervise the procurement officers under his supervision and ensure their compliance with this Act and any instructions, circulars or guidelines issued under this Act;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to implement and administer a complaints procedure as prescribed and review any complaint against the procuring entity under his purview; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40__subsec_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "to carry out such activities and do such things as are necessary, advantageous and proper for the administration of this Act, or such other purposes consistent with this Act as may be directed by the Secretary General to the Treasury or State financial authority, as the case may be."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A controlling officer may specify the extent to which the responsibilities imposed upon him under this section may be exercised or performed on his behalf by any public officer under his purview and give such directions as may be necessary to secure the proper exercise or performance of such responsibilities."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding subsection (2), the controlling officer shall be accountable for his responsibilities under subsection (1). Power to require information"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "41",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Secretary General to the Treasury or State financial authority, as the case may be, or any monitoring officer may, by notice in writing, require any person who administers, conducts or implements a Government procurement to provide any explanation, information, documents or records relating to the Government procurement so administered, conducted or implemented within the period and in the form and manner specified in the notice in writing."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person required to provide an explanation, information, document or record under subsection (1) shall ensure that the explanation, information, document or record provided is true, accurate and complete and such person shall provide an express representation to that effect, including a declaration that he is not aware of any other information which would make the explanation, information, document or record provided false or misleading. Power to require compliance assessment report"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_42",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "42",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of exercising its powers under this Part, the Secretary General to the Treasury or State financial authority, as the case may be, may, either generally or for a specific Government procurement, require a controlling officer to submit a compliance assessment report which shall contain information relating to the compliance with this Act and any instructions, circulars or guidelines issued under this Act by the procuring entity under his supervision. Actions based on findings of compliance assessment report"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "43",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Secretary General to the Treasury or State financial authority, as the case may be, may, after receiving a compliance assessment report submitted under section 42, review and assess the report and record its findings."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If the Secretary General to the Treasury or State financial authority, as the case may be, is satisfied that, based on the findings, there is reasonable ground to believe that a non-compliance or contravention of this Act has or might have occurred, the following actions may be taken:"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the case of a non-compliance with any instructions, circulars or guidelines by any controlling officer or procurement officer, the Treasury or State financial authority, as the case may be, may recommend actions against the officer in accordance with the relevant written laws relating to public service; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the case of a contravention of this Act, the Treasury or State financial authority, as the case may be, may investigate for offences and take action in accordance with this Act. Duty to report to enforcement agencies"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "44",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person who administers, conducts or implements any Government procurement shall report to the relevant enforcement agency if he becomes aware of a commission of any offence relating to corruption, competition or any other offences under any written laws as may be determined by the Secretary General to the Treasury."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purpose of subsection (1), it shall be sufficient for a procurement officer to report in writing to his controlling officer."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "37",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person administering, conducting or implementing a Government procurement having directly or indirectly by himself, a member of his family or his associates any interest in any matter in a Government procurement shall disclose the fact and nature of his interest including any beneficial ownership."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person making an application for a registration or any registered person making an application for a renewal or amendment of a registration under section 18 shall disclose to the Registrar—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any direct or indirect interest by himself, a member of his family or his associates in relation to any other registered person or person applying for a registration under section 18; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the beneficial owner to any person making the application or any registered person, as the case may be."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_3__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_3__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The obligation under subsection (2) shall extend to—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the case of a company, the directors, shareholders and senior management of the company;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the case of a partnership, all the partners in the partnership; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_3__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the case of a co-operative, any person holding the key responsibility in the management of the co-operative."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_4__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_4__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any registered person participating or intending to participate in a Government procurement under this Act shall be required to disclose to the procuring entity responsible for the Government procurement—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_4__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any beneficial owner of the registered person; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_4__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_4__para_b__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any direct or indirect interest by himself, a member of his family or his associates in relation to—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_4__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_4__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any other registered person, whether or not the other registered person is participating or intends to participate in that Government procurement; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_4__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_4__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any person under the purview of the procuring entity who is involved in the conduct of the Government procurement."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person who contravenes this section commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding two hundred and fifty thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this section—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a__subpara_iii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a__subpara_iv",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a__subpara_v"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "“a member of his family”, in relation to a person, member of a procurement board or member of a procurement committee, includes—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "his spouse;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "his parent, including a parent of his spouse;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "his child, including an adopted child or stepchild;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a__subpara_iv",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iv",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "his brother or sister, including a brother or sister of his spouse; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a__subpara_v",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "v",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a spouse of his child, brother or sister;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b__subpara_iii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b__subpara_iv",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b__subpara_v",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b__subpara_vi"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "“associate”, in relation to a person, member of a procurement board or member of a procurement committee, means—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any person who is a nominee or an employee of such person;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a firm of which such person or any nominee of his is a partner;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a partner of such person;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b__subpara_iv",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iv",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a trustee of a trust under which such person or a member of his family is a beneficiary;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b__subpara_v",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "v",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any corporation within the meaning of the Labuan Companies Act 1990 or the Companies Act 2016, as the case may be, of which or in which such person or any nominee of his or a member of his family is a director or has a substantial shareholding; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b__subpara_vi",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "vi",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the case of a co-operative society, includes any person holding the key responsibility in the management of the co-operative society. Prohibition against intervention in Government procurement"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "38",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No person shall, directly or indirectly, intervene or, by intimidation, undue influence or in any other manner interfere, in an active procurement so as to cause or which is likely to cause a departure from the procurement process under this Act or any instructions, circulars or guidelines issued under this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any person who contravenes this section commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding five hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_3__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this section—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "“active procurement” means the period from the date an approval to commence a Government procurement is given by a controlling officer until the date the letter of acceptance is signed by parties;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "“letter of acceptance” means an official letter issued by a procuring entity informing the unconditional acceptance by the Government of the offer submitted by the successful registered person."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_28",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "28",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_28__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_28__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_28__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_28__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_28",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subject to the provisions of this Act, the open and competitive procurement method shall be the primary method in conducting Government procurement."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_28__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_28",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding subsection (1), the Minister may prescribe the methods other than open and competitive procurement taking into consideration the objectives of this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_28__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_28",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this section, “open and competitive procurement method” means a procurement method where all registered persons may participate. Specific policy and measures in Government procurement"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_29",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "29",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding the provisions of this Act, the Minister or, in relation to a State, the Menteri Besar or Chief Minister, as the case may be, may, if he considers it in the national or state interest to do so, implement any policy or measures in any Government procurement to encourage, promote, stimulate or facilitate social, economic and environmental development in Malaysia or any particular State, as the case may be. Specific procedure during period of urgency"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_30",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "30",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may prescribe the procedure for any Government procurement during a period of urgency which requires immediate action in the interest of public order, health or safety. Provisions for implementing international obligations"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_31",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "31",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may prescribe the methods and procedures for Government procurement as may be required or necessary for implementing obligations arising from international agreements to which Malaysia is a party. Procurement Public Interest Certificate"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_32",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "32",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_32",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A procuring entity may issue a Procurement Public Interest Certificate to declare any Government procurement within its purview as crucial for public interest reasons and shall not be delayed or suspended by any objection or appeal under this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_32__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_32",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may prescribe the conditions and procedure for the issuance of the Procurement Public Interest Certificate under this section. Government procurement contract"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_33",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "33",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A Government procurement contract between a procuring entity and a registered person shall be made in the form and manner and subject to such terms and conditions as may be prescribed by the Minister. Administration of Government procurement contract"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_34",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "34",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The manner for resolving disputes in relation to the administration of Government procurement contract shall be as prescribed by the Minister. Prohibition on transfer, etc., of Government procurement grant or contract"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_35",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "35",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_35",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No registered person shall transfer, assign or novate in any manner a grant or contract awarded under this Act, in total or in part, or any interest in a grant or contract awarded under this Act to any person in any manner without the prior approval of the controlling officer responsible for the Government procurement."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_35__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_35",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any registered person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine of not less than three times the value of the grant or contract awarded under this Act or one million ringgit, whichever is higher, or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both. Computerized system for administration of Government procurement"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V__cl_36",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "36",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/28/eng@/~part_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Minister may prescribe for the use of any computerized system for the administration and conduct of Government procurement under this Act."
      }
    },
    {
